 <name>scope</name>
 <channel>pecl.php.net</channel>
 <summary>Scope: the identity of the operation (request, job) that code belongs to</summary>
 <description>The Scope class proposed in the PHP RFC "Scope", for PHP 8.2 and later. Fibers and generators belong to the scope current at their creation; Scope::getRootScope() is the scope outside any Scope::run().</description>
 <lead>
  <name>Frode Børli</name>
  <user>frodeborli</user>
  <email>frode@ennerd.com</email>
  <active>yes</active>
 </lead>
